SUMMARY:Bible Study (Guild Room)
DESCRIPTION:For four Tuesdays\, beginning on April 14th\, Rev. Katrina will be leading a daytime Bible study group around the book of Revelation. \nFrom Daytime Bible Study Leader Paul N:\nDuring Daytime Bible Study\, we discuss the Bible and books that analyze the Bible in depth. We also have fun and food. In 2024\, we studied Mark and screened films Sabbath and 1946: The Mistranslation That Shifted A Culture. We read books about Holy Week\, the Sabbath\, The Sermon On The Mount\, and Biblical women. All reference resources\, translations\, and interpretations are welcome. \nPast Bible Study Books Have Included:\nSabbath As Resistance by Walter Brueggeman\nEntering The Passion Of Jesus by Amy-Jill Levine\nJesus’ Alternative Plan: The Sermon On The Mount by Richard Rohr
URL:https://www.unioncong.org/event/bible-study-guild-room-3-3-3/
LOCATION:Guild Room
CATEGORIES:All Church Events,All Events,Featured Events,Small Groups
ORGANIZER;CN="Union Congregational Event":MAILTO:contact@unioncong.org
END:VEVENT
