DESCRIPTION:Friday\, April 24th – 6-8:30pm – Let’s Watch Film – The Visitor (2007\, 1h44)\n\n\nThe Visitor is a quiet\, deeply moving drama that explores themes of loneliness\, immigration\, and the unexpected connections that can bridge cultural divides. Pizza will be provided. The trailer for the movie is on the RSVP form and in the church’s web calendar listing.  (Click here to view the Trailer.) \n\nClick here to RSVP For Let’s Watch “The Visitor” – April 24\, 6pm
