SUMMARY:Oratorio Society Spring Concert (Sanctuary and Assembly Room)
DESCRIPTION:Oratorio Society New Jersey presents a musical celebration of the 250th anniversary of the signing of the Declaration of Independence. The program includes sacred and secular music from the colonial era up through the present day\, including classic spirituals and well-loved compositions by Leonard Bernstein\, George Gershwin\, and Duke Ellington.  www.oratoriosocietynj.org/tickets
